# Antigravity Git Widget — Environment Variables

# Public GitHub OAuth App Client ID for Device Flow login (no client_secret needed).
# Forks can override this at build time or runtime with their own GitHub OAuth App Client ID
# (make sure "Enable Device Flow" is checked and "Expire user access tokens" is unchecked).
GITHUB_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=Ov23lig6JmbXKRt6zC2D

# Optional: Loopback HTTP port when running `git-widget-sidecar --serve` manually outside Antigravity.
# Antigravity injects this automatically at runtime.
# ANTIGRAVITY_SIDECAR_WEB_PORT=39871

# Optional: Override GitHub repository ("owner/repo") checked for in-app widget updates.
# Priority: settings.json (update_repo) -> GIT_WIDGET_UPDATE_REPO -> KonstantinVladimirtsev69/Antigravity-Git-Widget
# GIT_WIDGET_UPDATE_REPO=KonstantinVladimirtsev69/Antigravity-Git-Widget
